			"date": "2023-02-25T10:36:28.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.online/@escarpment\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>escarpment</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@eleventy\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>eleventy</span></a></span> As a googler who has to use internal Bazel, I wish it return to it's 2010s cave.</p><p>I can see the use for it in a company of 10k+, but it really hampers development speed, and the DX just aint there. Maybe something else that iterates on its values, though.</p>",
